  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}拒绝他们太可怜了{F5 47 02 01 03 01 0D 01 01 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:55:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK054",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}战力越多越好{F5 47 02 01 03 01 0D 01 01 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:55:2",
  "message_id": "SEL_TALK054",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}怎么办呢{F5 47 02 01 03 01 09 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:56:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_055",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 43 01}……那就暂时让他们加入吧。\n他们或许掌握着\n关于这个地方的线索。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:57:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_056",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 29 01 02 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 44 01}那就拜托了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:58:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_057",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 45 01}那就拜托了呢。\n请多多关照！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:59:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_058",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 46 01}嘿嘿……\n一放心下来，肚子就饿了！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:60:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_059",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 47 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}嚼嚼……果然甜甜圈\n还是洞旁边最好吃！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:61:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_060",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 48 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}咦，你从哪儿拿出来的！？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:62:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_061",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 09 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 49 01}我知道的。\n甜甜圈是从爱里诞生的。\n爱 MEETS 甜甜圈。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:63:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_062",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 10 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4A 01}原来不是用高筋面粉做的。\n这就更新资料。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:64:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_063",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4B 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}不，不用更新啦。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:64:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_063",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4C 01}话说你叫……善，对吧？\n刚才说了“迷宫”，对不对？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:64:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_063",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4D 01}果然，这个展项里面……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:65:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_064",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4E 01}里面的结构非常复杂。\n也有很多怪物……恐怕就是\n你们称为“阴影”的存在。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:66:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_065",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4F 01}……在、在这种地方，\n你们之前都是怎么过的？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:66:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_065",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 50 01}出不去，又没有记忆，\n还有阴影出没……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:67:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_066",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 51 01}和善一起过的呀？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:68:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_067",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 52 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}不是问这个……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:69:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_068",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 01 01 09 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 53 01}吃甜甜圈、吃章鱼烧，\n还有舔冰淇淋。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:70:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_069",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 54 01}……就这些？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:71:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_070",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 03 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 55 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}美式热狗也非常好吃！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:72:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_071",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0B 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 56 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}啊，嗯，我明白了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:73:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_072",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 02 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 57 01}看来还是只能\n到这个展项里面调查一下了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:74:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_073",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 58 01}嗯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:75:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_074",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 59 01}……要进去吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:76:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_075",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 02 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5A 01}玲，你害怕吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:77:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_076",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 07 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5B 01}……害怕。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:78:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_077",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5C 01}你要留在这里等吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:79:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_078",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5D 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}我不要一个人……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:80:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_079",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5E 01}玲，你想离开这里，对吧？\n没事的，我会保护你。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:81:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_080",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 04 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 5F 01}嗯……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:82:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_081",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 0F 01 03 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 60 01}呵呵。\n你们两个关系真好呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:83:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_082",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 29 01 03 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 61 01}我们约好要一直在一起。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:84:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_083",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 0C 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0B 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 62 01}顺平，找到同类了呢。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:85:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_084",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0C 01 09 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 63 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 08 01}哎呀，别嫉妒嘛。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:86:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_085",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 64 01}{F1 81}。\n先调整编队吧。\n得决定前线成员才行。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:87:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_086",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 03 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 65 01}我要去。\n阿真，你也来。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:88:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_087",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 13 01 07 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 66 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}凭什么由你决定。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:89:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_088",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 67 01}不……说得对，我们三年级的去吧。\n不能让低年级的同伴\n面对未知的危险。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:90:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_089",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 29 01 02 01 02 01 02 01}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 0B 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 68 01}……啊，对了，善和玲\n是几年级的？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:90:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_089",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 69 01}我不知不觉就把你们\n当成学弟学妹来讲话了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:91:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_090",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6A 01}几年级？\n……不知道。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:92:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_091",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0E 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6B 01}……那么暂且\n当作是一年级吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:92:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_091",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 0E 01 0D 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6C 01}虽然刚说过不能让低年级冒险，\n很抱歉，还是请善和玲一起上前线。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:92:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_091",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6D 01}你说过能和怪物战斗，\n我想亲眼确认一下。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:93:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_092",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6E 01}嗯，明白了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e100/e100_060.bf.json:94:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_093",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0F 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 6F 01}我会在这里为大家提供支援。\n请小心！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
